### 4. GET - Svi ispitni rokovi
GET http://localhost:8090/api/ispitni-rokovi/all

### 5. GET - Po ID (rok sa ID=1)
GET http://localhost:8090/api/ispitni-rokovi/1

### 6. GET - Po školskoj godini (godina ID=1)
GET http://localhost:8090/api/ispitni-rokovi/godina/1

### 7. PUT - Update Januarskog roka (ID=1)
PUT http://localhost:8090/api/ispitni-rokovi/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "naziv": "Januarski rok - IZMENJENO",
  "skolskaGodinaId": 1,
  "pocetak": "2024-01-20",
  "kraj": "2024-02-20",
  "aktivan": false
}

### 8. GET - Proveri izmenu (ID=1)
GET http://localhost:8090/api/ispitni-rokovi/1

### 9. DELETE - Obriši Avgustovski rok (ID=3)
DELETE http://localhost:8090/api/ispitni-rokovi/3

### 10. GET - Proveri sve rokove posle DELETE
GET http://localhost:8090/api/ispitni-rokovi/all